---
layout: default
title: Startseite
---
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-content container"><span class="eyebrow">Eisenbahn & ÖPNV</span><h1>Neuigkeiten auf der Schiene.</h1><p>Aktuelle Meldungen, Baustellen, Fahrzeuge und spannende Themen – mit besonderem Blick auf Baden-Württemberg.</p><a class="button" href="#meldungen">Zu den Meldungen ↓</a></div></section>
{% assign breaking = site.posts | where: "breaking", true | first %}{% if breaking %}<section class="container"><a class="breaking" href="{{ breaking.url | relative_url }}"><span>🔴 Eilmeldung</span><strong>{{ breaking.title }}</strong><small>Artikel lesen →</small></a></section>{% endif %}
<section class="container section" id="meldungen"><span class="eyebrow">Neueste Beiträge</span><h2>Aktuelle Meldungen</h2><div class="post-grid">{% for post in site.posts %}<article class="post-card"><a class="post-image" href="{{ post.url | relative_url }}">{% if post.image %}<img src="{{ post.image | relative_url }}" alt="{{ post.alt | default: post.title }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<img src="{{ '/assets/images/placeholder.svg' | relative_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</a><div class="post-body"><div class="post-meta"><span class="tag">📰 {{ post.categories | first | default: "Meldung" }}</span><time>{{ post.date | date: "%d.%m.%Y" }}</time></div><h3><a href="{{ post.url | relative_url }}">{{ post.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ post.excerpt | strip_html | truncate: 155 }}</p><a class="read-more" href="{{ post.url | relative_url }}">Artikel lesen →</a></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="container section" id="kategorien"><span class="eyebrow">Themen</span><h2>Kategorien</h2><div class="category-grid">{% assign cats = site.posts | map: "categories" | join: "," | split: "," | uniq | sort %}{% for cat in cats %}{% if cat != "" %}<a class="category-card" href="#meldungen">🚆 <strong>{{ cat }}</strong></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="container section about" id="ueber-mich"><span class="eyebrow">Über den Blog</span><h2>Eisenbahn-News aus der Region</h2><p>Eigene Meldungen und Beiträge zu Eisenbahn, ÖPNV, Baustellen, Fahrzeugen und weiteren Themen.</p></section>
